      "message": "feat(ui): a viewport Pick through toggle lets picks reach the far side\n\nThe nav column gains a \"Pick through\" button, off by default and drawn\nas off. When on, viewport feature picks send `through: true`, so a click\ncan take an edge or point behind the near surface. It is view state like\nthe axes toggle, not an undoable command (docs/decisions/692-pick-through-mode.md).\n\nRefs #692\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
